 class=\"prf-lede prf-story\">As of Oct 12, the record on the middle value of the county&rsquo;s 8 grids runs from 1951 to 2025, and January to February came in under 90% of normal in 36 of those 75 years. In 2025 that same pair ran 28% of normal on the middle of the grids. So far in 2026, May to June came in at 53% on the middle of the grids. Grid 29253 had the driest year of any grid, 1976 at 57% of normal.</p>"}
